2) Transolver / Physics Attention
   - The spatial Transolver blocks and Physics Attention modules in
     dynasolver/models/Transolver.py and dynasolver/layers/Physics_Attention.py
     follow the Transolver architecture and public reference implementations:
     https://github.com/thuml/Transolver
   - Please cite the Transolver paper when comparing against or extending
     these spatial modules.

3) GeoPT (optional pretrained backbone)
